  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4602.01 Use of Trade Names",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-06-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4602.01 Use of Trade Names. Household goods carriers governed by these rules shall not conduct business under any trade name until a copy of the certificate of registration of trade name by the secretary of state pursuant to the provisions of RSA 349 has been filed with the bureau.\n\nSource. #5852, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7240, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9379, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12358, eff 8-2-17; ss by #13828, eff 12-22-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)",
